# Edge Cases & UX Rules

- Handle empty input gracefully:
  - Show empty result (no errors).
- Preserve all characters exactly (including spaces, emojis, punctuation).
- Do not trim unless explicitly requested.
- If input is very long, solution must still work efficiently.
- Keep UI feedback clear and immediate.